    status: 'Live',
    sector: 'Commercial',
    image: '/assets/reynolds/project-image-coming-soon.svg',
    services: ['SFS', 'Partitioning', 'Ceilings', 'Plastering'],
    description:
      "Reynolds Building Systems is delivering the drylining package for GRAHAM's landmark redevelopment of The Castle Rock School in Coalville, Leicestershire. The £37 million Department for Education project is transforming the existing secondary school campus through the construction of a modern two-storey teaching facility, refurbishment of retained buildings, and the creation of high-quality learning environments for up to 1,550 students.",
  },
